id=thor-stickfx
name=Thor joystick LED effects (stickfx)
version=v0.5.0
versionCode=500
author=local
description=Adds charging indication and breathe effects to the AYN Thor's 8 joystick RGB LEDs on LineageOS. An ADD-ON to the ROM's own AynParts RGB panel, not a replacement: it writes only trigger/delay_on/delay_off and leaves multi_intensity (colour) to AynParts unless --color is used explicitly. Charging indication is handled by a kernel LED trigger, so there is no polling daemon: by default usb-online (lit whenever the charger is connected), because every battery-status trigger goes dark while LineageOS charging control holds the battery at its limit - the kernel reports 'Not charging' there. Selectable and persisted with --trigger. Installing changes nothing until a mode is selected; disable or uninstall restores the LEDs recorded at boot.
